</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆与██品牌共享单车无异的共享单车，其异常性质在于车辆标牌无法被电子设备识别，且无涂抹痕迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>吉林省██市██路██商场门口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>就近收容于Site-CN-05低价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>成像非常清晰，但就是识别不上，气得半死。一一研究员Miku ████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00185" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00185-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3522164&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606187329" alt="Miku Maekawa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3522164)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;">Miku Maekawa</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589269677 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 07:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00385/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支██牌的麦克风，当使用其演唱歌曲时，无论演唱水平如何使用者周边的人都会声称其“唱得很难听”，但若使用其进行发言等活动则无此异常。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020年8月██日<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███省██市██区██宾馆会议室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被入住该宾馆的特工发现并收容，现封存于Site-CN-53低价值物品收容柜。另外购买了一支型号相同的麦克风代替之<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我不想说话，别来管我。</em>——逆光特工<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-277538-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-277538-1')">1</a></sup><br />
<em>逆光恐怕最不想听的就是“你唱得好烂”这句话了。</em>——研究员Sunny</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00385" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00385" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00385-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5374263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5374263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606187330" alt="Backlight SH" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5374263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5374263); return false;">Backlight SH</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598870124 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 Aug 2020 10:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-277538-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-277538-1')">1</a>. 曾有过花了很大精力准备的歌曲被人戏称“唱得好烂”的创伤经历。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一件男士休闲衬衫。<br />
<span style="color: #bb0000">A.展开更多</span> <span style="color: #bb0000">B.展开更多</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.展开更多</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目具有认知危害和信息危害，人类将项目穿上、认知项目以及描述项目的行为均会使自身受到精神影响，具体表现为在需要做出有3个以上选项的抉择时，将会明显地倾向于选择第3个选项。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被Dr.Coldmist于██服饰店以£9.15的价格购得。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容柜。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00374" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00374-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606187330" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598068525 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Aug 2020 03:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00124/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把经过异常改造的███牌AK-47水弹枪，当使用项目射出水弹时，水弹会转变为7.62mm步枪弹。值得注意的是子弹在打出后是未击发的状态。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> ███市一市民家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-██异常武器收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>无限子弹补给？</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00124" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00124" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00124-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606187330" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
